### Root
GET http://localhost:1198/


### Health Check
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/health


### Register
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ashish Ranjan",
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "StrongPassword123"
}


### Verify Email
### Replace the sample token with verificationToken from the Register or Resend Verification response
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "6e68dd4fc76a8ebebc75ad3f9bfe711e7f20f60c29ba2d05953f11ca40c2e0e5"
}


### Resend Verification
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com"
}


### Login
### Successful login sets accessToken and refreshToken as HttpOnly cookies
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "StrongPassword123"
}


### Get Authenticated Profile
### Run Login first so the accessToken cookie is available
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/profile


### Refresh Access Token
### Uses the refreshToken HttpOnly cookie created during Login
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/refresh


### Get Profile After Refresh
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/profile


### Logout
### Clears accessToken and refreshToken cookies
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/logout


### Profile After Logout
### Expected: 401 Authentication required
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/profile


### Login Again
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "StrongPassword123"
}


### Forgot Password
### Copy resetToken from the response
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com"
}


### Reset Password
### Replace the token with resetToken from Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "97b8ea2cca458dde55818d72ba2ea6ca93a143d1c5a1a5622656649d7b3b75e7",
    "password": "NewStrongPassword123"
}


### Login With Old Password
### Expected: 401 Invalid email or password
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "StrongPassword123"
}


### Login With New Password
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "NewStrongPassword123"
}


### Duplicate Registration
### Expected: 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ashish Ranjan",
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "AnotherPassword123"
}


### Invalid Registration
### Expected: 400 Validation failed
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "email": "invalid-email",
    "password": "123"
}


### Invalid Login
### Expected: 401 Invalid email or password
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ashish@example.com",
    "password": "WrongPassword123"
}


### Invalid Verification Token
### Expected: 400
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "invalid-verification-token"
}


### Invalid Password Reset Token
### Expected: 400
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "invalid-reset-token",
    "password": "NewStrongPassword123"
}


### Invalid Route
### Expected: 404 Route not found
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/not-found
